  "prefLabel": "Lot 7002.30 Shared carry-over coverall",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lot 7002.30 “Shared carry-over coverall” means “shared carry-over coverall” as defined in RSA 287-E:1, X, namely “a carry-over coverall bingo game conducted at a host hall and exhibited simultaneously to at least one participating hall by means of an electronic simulcast feed for the purpose of playing for a common jackpot with the conduct of the game at the host hall under rules adopted by the commission under RSA 541-A.”\n\nSource. #13067, eff 6-26-20; ss by #14138, eff 11-27-24, EXPIRES: 11-27-34 (formerly Lot 7002.27)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/lot7000.html"
